}],"ai_disruption":[0,0,0,0.0]},"move":{"r1":-0.068,"r5":-0.0484,"r20":-0.0054,"r1_spy":-0.0679,"r5_spy":-0.0399,"r20_spy":-0.0021}}],"quotes":[{"c":"QRVO 2019 Q2","e":"qrvo","d":"2018-10-31","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"James Klein","x":"We also have customers experiencing some shortages in other materials that are affecting their production and some impacts of tariffs as they transition some of their manufacturing locations.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/31/qorvo-inc-qrvo-q2-2019-earnings-conference-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"QRVO 2019 Q2","e":"qrvo","d":"2018-10-31","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Robert Bruggeworth","x":"Let me start with a little broader comment that we've assessed the impact on us from the different sets of tariffs that have been imposed by the U.S. and China, what's been imposed so far.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/31/qorvo-inc-qrvo-q2-2019-earnings-conference-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"QRVO 2019 Q3","e":"qrvo","d":"2019-02-07","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Robert Bruggeworth","x":"One is there has been a delay in the AX or WiFi 6 standard release, still some unrelated materials shortages and some impact of tariffs as some of our customers relocate their manufacturing outside of China, but we believe that business has found its bottom and is starting to recover back.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/07/qorvo-inc-qrvo-q3-2019-earnings-conference-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"QRVO 2019 Q3","e":"qrvo","d":"2019-02-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark Murphy","x":"…next fourth quarters, we expect to record approximately $100 million of additional charges related to accelerated depreciation of Florida production assets, as well as employee termination and other exit costs related to Florida, Texas and other locations impacted by our restructuring actions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/07/qorvo-inc-qrvo-q3-2019-earnings-conference-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"QRVO 2019 Q3","e":"qrvo","d":"2019-02-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark Murphy","x":"These restructuring costs will be excluded from our non-GAAP results and I refer you to our 10-Q filed today for additional details.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/07/qorvo-inc-qrvo-q3-2019-earnings-conference-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"QRVO 2019 Q4","e":"qrvo","d":"2019-05-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Eric Creviston","x":"Of course, as Bob said, we're not raising guidance for the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/08/qorvo-qrvo-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"QRVO 2020 Q1","e":"qrvo","d":"2019-08-01","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Raji Gill","x":"I'm just wondering if that -- if you're seeing any competition from your main products as it relates to the China trade war and any risk in China trying to in-source where possible?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/02/qorvo-qrvo-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"QRVO 2020 Q1","e":"qrvo","d":"2019-08-01","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Vijay Rakesh","x":"And just when you look at the complete landscape, I know we talked about the trade war and stuff.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/02/qorvo-qrvo-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"QRVO 2020 Q1","e":"qrvo","d":"2019-08-01","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Mark Murphy","x":"Specifically, as it relates to Huawei, we have reduced our outlook to include only modest sales of Mobile Products.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/02/qorvo-qrvo-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"QRVO 2020 Q2","e":"qrvo","d":"2019-10-31","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Karl Ackerman","x":"We heard from the Korean smartphone manufacturer last night discussing the strength in China handsets, some of those OEMs procuring more memory, not only ahead of China tariffs, but also due to stronger demand.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/01/qorvo-qrvo-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"QRVO 2020 Q4","e":"qrvo","d":"2020-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark Murphy","x":"Though we expect a sequential decline in gross margin in the June quarter, our efforts to improve the portfolio, rightsize our manufacturing footprint and drive productivity are yielding favorable results.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/08/qorvo-qrvo-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"QRVO 2021 Q1","e":"qrvo","d":"2020-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark Murphy","x":"We've also, as you know, have gone through a lot around rightsizing our footprint and making sure that incremental capex dollars are directed at the right place, so we're getting good return for those.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/29/qorvo-inc-qrvo-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"QRVO 2021 Q2","e":"qrvo","d":"2020-11-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark Murphy","x":"And then we also had several years of getting the operations in order and driving productivity, right sizing the footprint and then being very diligent or more circumspect about capital spend, which continues to trend down as a percent of sales, we've been able to reduce our capital intensity.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/04/qorvo-inc-qrvo-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"QRVO 2022 Q1","e":"qrvo","d":"2021-08-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark Murphy","x":"You've always done a terrific job on productivity and the culture has matured here around cost savings and just getting more done with less and getting it done more efficiently, which benefits customers and all, and those are ongoing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/05/qorvo-inc-qrvo-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"QRVO 2022 Q1","e":"qrvo","d":"2021-08-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark Murphy","x":"But a big move here for us is the move to integrated modules, more sophisticated modules and then just our operational performance and driving cost out, better utilizing our factories, getting FX cost absorption, spends in control.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/05/qorvo-inc-qrvo-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"QRVO 2022 Q2","e":"qrvo","d":"2021-11-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert Bruggeworth","x":"In automotive manufacturing, Qorvo was selected to supply ultrawideband and Zigbee solutions with ConcurrentConnect technology to an automaker in Korea, streamlining automation and manufacturing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/03/qorvo-inc-qrvo-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"QRVO 2025 Q2","e":"qrvo","d":"2024-10-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Robert Bruggeworth","x":"In industrial and enterprise, we continue to ramp power management solutions for enterprise SSDs to more broadly serve AI and data center applications and expand on our strong position and client SSDs for laptops.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/26/qorvo-qrvo-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"QRVO 2025 Q2","e":"qrvo","d":"2024-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Grant Brown","x":"This is a further example of the proactive steps we are taking and continue to evaluate in order to streamline operations and improve gross margin.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/26/qorvo-qrvo-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"QRVO 2025 Q2","e":"qrvo","d":"2024-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Krish Sankar","x":"So with the TAM reduction, et cetera, is it fair to assume restructuring plus focus on profitable opportunities is kind of what gets you to 50% or do you think there are other levers that you could pull?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/26/qorvo-qrvo-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"QRVO 2026 Q1","e":"qrvo","d":"2025-07-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Bob Bruggeworth","x":"Growth applications include enterprise and AI data centers, wearables, drones, robotics, smartphones, and advanced power management solutions for AESA radars.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/07/qorvo-qrvo-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"QRVO 2026 Q1","e":"qrvo","d":"2025-07-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Grant Brown","x":"While we've seen limited tariff-related inventory buffering at a few customers, we believe these effects are modest and secondary to the underlying demand drivers and Qorvo-specific content growth reflected in our outlook.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/07/qorvo-qrvo-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"QRVO 2026 Q1","e":"qrvo","d":"2025-07-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Grant Brown","x":"The sequential increase in OpEx reflects higher incentive-based compensation, given the expected outperformance during the first half of the fiscal year, FX headwinds related to the weak US dollar, and the impact of tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/07/qorvo-qrvo-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"QRVO 2026 Q1","e":"qrvo","d":"2025-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Grant Brown","x":"For modeling purposes, shutdown and restructuring activities such as those related to the closure of our North Carolina and Costa Rica sites are excluded from non-GAAP results.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/07/qorvo-qrvo-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"QRVO 2026 Q2","e":"qrvo","d":"2025-11-03","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Robert A. Bruggeworth","x":"We are leveraging the performance advantages of our PMIC and motor control portfolio to expand content in AESA radars, drones, enterprise and AI data centers, smartphones, and wearables.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/04/qorvo-qrvo-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"QRVO 2026 Q2","e":"qrvo","d":"2025-11-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert A. Bruggeworth","x":"I will cover the business strategy driving these results, as well as restructuring actions we are taking to enhance profitability and quarterly strategic achievements.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/04/qorvo-qrvo-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"QRVO 2026 Q2","e":"qrvo","d":"2025-11-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert A. Bruggeworth","x":"We are restructuring CSG to increase our focus on our top opportunities and improve profitability.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/04/qorvo-qrvo-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"QRVO 2026 Q3","e":"qrvo","d":"2026-01-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert Bruggeworth","x":"We continue to pursue our long-term growth strategy while executing on restructuring actions to optimize profitability and reduce capital intensity.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/27/qorvo-qrvo-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"QRVO 2026 Q3","e":"qrvo","d":"2026-01-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert Bruggeworth","x":"Regarding the CSG restructuring discussed last quarter, these actions remain on track.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/27/qorvo-qrvo-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[35,1,8494,0,0,0,5611,2376],[36,1,8154,0,0,0,6103,1651],[37,1,8122,0,0,0,5675,1980],[38,1,8290,0,0,0,5596,2221],[39,1,7896,0,0,0,5478,2002],[40,1,7670,0,0,0,5394,1912],[41,1,8115,0,0,0,6318,1446],[42,1,7770,0,0,0,6298,1183],[43,1,8229,0,0,0,6257,1645],[44,1,7854,0,0,0,6109,1456],[45,1,8787,0,0,0,5662,2778],[46,1,8017,0,0,0,5320,2324],[47,1,8820,0,0,0,5734,2704],[59,1,7687,0,0,0,6173,1228],[62,1,8275,0,0,0,5921,1912],[63,1,59